 Cunina octonaria, oral view (15); Chrysaora lactea, ephyra (16); young Beroe ovata (17); Doliolum nationalis, lateral view of phorozooid (18), gonozooid (19) and old nurse (20). FIGURES 21 – 24. Cnidostoma fallax Vanhöffen, 1911. Lateral view of the medusa (21). Aboral view of manubrium with medusoid buds; notice buds in different developmental stages (22). Lateral view of manubrium showing buds and the cnidophores on mouth rim (23). Detail of the mouth rim with stalked cnidophores (24).","","text","",""]]},"NDXP6":{"d":[["CYM","KY","iso","",""]]},"NJNQY":{"d":[["Sweden","SE","iso","native",""]]},"P3V7":{"d":[["Borneo","","text","",""]]},"P457":{"d":[["Antarctica","8588","mrgid","",""],["Atlantic Coast of South America","17376","mrgid","",""],["Australian Exclusive Economic Zone","8323","mrgid","",""],["Chilean Exclusive Economic Zone","8465","mrgid","",""],["Heard and Macdonald Islands","21955","mrgid","",""],["High seas of the South Atlantic Ocean","26561","mrgid","",""],["New Zealand Exclusive Economic Zone","8455","mrgid","",""],["New Zealand Exclusive Economic Zone","8455","mrgid","",""],["New Zealand Exclusive Economic Zone","8455","mrgid","",""],["Overlapping claim Falkland / Malvinas Islands: United Kingdom / Argentina part of the South Atlantic Ocean","25513","mrgid","",""],["South African part of the South Atlantic Ocean","25516","mrgid","",""],["South America","1925","mrgid","",""],["South Georgian Exclusive Economic Zone (Overlapping claim)","8383","mrgid","",""]]},"P8FPR":{"d":[["Distribution. Madagascar.","","text","",""]]},"PBWG":{"d":[["","WAU","tdwg","",""]]},"PK8SJ":{"d":[["Distribution. Northeast India (Meghalaya and Arunachal Pradesh) (Hampson 1900; Kirti & Singh 2016), northern Myanmar (Shan State) (Hampson 1894), south-western China (Xizang) (Huang et al. 2021) and North Thailand (Chiang Mai Province) (Černý & Pinratana 2009, partim). The records from the Thailand provinces of Lampang, Tak, Sakhon Nakhon and Nakhon Ratchasima by Černý & Pinrat